{"parse": {"title": "4TH-01", "pageid": 6091, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/3RD-16\" title=\"3RD-16\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">4TH-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/4TH-02\" title=\"4TH-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">4TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.A7.E9.9B.A8.E4.BC.9E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"旧雨伞\">旧雨伞</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 旧雨伞</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">An Old Umbrella</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>过<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>寂<span class=\"color-value\"></span>静<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>陈<span class=\"color-value\"></span>旧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>所<span class=\"color-value\"></span>熟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>识<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>黑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>色<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10401</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-300311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-300311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-300311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzineiwanshang\"><img alt=\"0xiangzineiwanshang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-300310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-300310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-300310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>维尔汀……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窗外的光穿过了一座停滞的雕像。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_shisihema.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_shisihema\"><img alt=\"at_shisihema\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/Cg-at_shisihema.png/600px-Cg-at_shisihema.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/Cg-at_shisihema.png/900px-Cg-at_shisihema.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/Cg-at_shisihema.png/1200px-Cg-at_shisihema.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-300310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-300310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-300310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>我看见……维尔汀她……被“暴雨”——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>……不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>只是一个噩梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzineiwanshang\"><img alt=\"0xiangzineiwanshang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>修长的影子站起身来。偌大的庭院空着，只剩下她一人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>一个过于清晰的噩梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>是因为我太久没有见到她们了么？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这个地方鲜有如此静谧的时刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回到基金会以后，所有人都被接连邀请去与机构人员单独交谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>维尔汀……是最先离开的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>她说要去与Z女士谈谈我们的编制归属问题，自此以后便再没有消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的。这是我撰写的背景报告，请您过目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>接着，是苏芙比。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>邀请扫去了她多日的沉闷，她告别得匆忙，以至于将最心爱的玩偶落在了地毯上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这是苏芙比，一位受过良好教育的传统神秘学家庭出身的淑女。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>她曾在极度优渥的环境中成长，家族在世界各地拥有特殊的影响力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>除此以外，她缺乏一定的社会常识与科学技术知识，同化难度较高。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">槲寄生：</div><div>与苏芙比相比起来，APPLe先生显然不太乐意接受邀请。他离开的时候，颜色都有些发青。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>APPLe先生，与他谦和的外表不同，他的性格中藏有审视的锋芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他的学识相当渊博，对我们的历史情报一向有着独到的经验与见解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>据我所知，他一直对星锑船长被迫加入基金会一事感到不满。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>而基金会并没有真正地接纳星锑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>她的人生错过了基金会成员应受到的所有教育与训练。她现有的烙印，就像是基金会里一面过于鲜艳的旗帜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这面旗帜的加入，在基金会内部引发了新的争论——这一切都让我们派系的矛盾变得更加尖锐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>派系？基金会不应存在派系，我们只有一个共同目标。这一点，你很清楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>可是矛盾一直存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>而且愈演愈烈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>推崇人类至上主义的团体，正在分裂着基金会的信仰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……看来这些年你并不只是在观测时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这些矛盾已经无法再用一纸章程来掩盖了，Z女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>“暴雨”持续了八年。所有停留在原地的人，都摆脱不了它的影响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>人类科技在倒退，而神秘学却愈发昌盛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>第一场猝不及防的雨，让基金会失去了大半的精英成员。直至现在，共融院与委员会的任职人数都无法再回到当年的盛况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>为了与重塑之手抗衡，我们不断地吸纳外部的神秘学家……直到基金会内部抗议的声音愈来愈大……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>大到凝聚成了一个难以撼动的新群体，人类党团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不受控的新增力量正在加深他们的恐惧。他们要求毋庸置疑的话语权，以及对神秘学家更为严苛的管制。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>Z女士，我不希望我和我的朋友们，成为这场漩涡的牺牲品——就像四年前那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>所以你带来了这些神秘学家的背景分析报告，作为谈判桌上的佐证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>你想要的是什么？维尔汀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>一个中立，安全，合法的立足之地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>不担心我也是人类党团的其中一员？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我不了解您的立场。但我相信，您所追求的未来，一定不包含因党争而分崩离析的结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这一点，我已经在那个雨夜里得到了答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>您的眼神……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不属于那一场棋局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……资料留下吧。我需要一些时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不论结果如何……谢谢您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>办公室里只剩下一个白色的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她翻阅着文件，叹了口气，拿起电话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>帮我转接代表人马克的办公室。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>长廊位于委员会与共融院之间，如同一座联结二者权力的桥梁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟悉或陌生的面孔来去匆匆，抱着仅有十分之一通过率的议案在走廊上奔走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员Ⅰ：</div><div>嘿！维尔汀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……你好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员Ⅰ：</div><div>你的朋友在康复中心等你。小梅斯梅尔，你还记得吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员Ⅱ：</div><div>让我们带你过去叙叙旧吧。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "4TH-01"}}